    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i did good work, but that was then. that version of me is gone. now it's just me waiting for the day to end so i can do it all again tomorrow. it's like the movie already finished playing and i'm just stuck in the credits. does it ever stop feeling like you've just run out of things to do? like there's nothing left to contribute?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
